{"sha": "fbc016c0a60d6291631128f3dd132729d8523f7889d6d70796ebc03ab883c0c6", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:work-and-energy} 章 --- 功、能量与势能}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:1}", "提升力 $+mgh = 20 \\times 9.81 \\times 3.0 = \\qty{589}{J}$；重力", "$-\\qty{589}{J}$；功率 $589/5.0 = \\qty{118}{W}$。摩擦力：$-\\mu_dmgd =", "-0.30 \\times 196 \\times 3.0 = \\qty{-177}{J}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:2}", "$E_k = \\tfrac12 \\times 1000 \\times 27.8^2 = \\qty{386}{kJ}$；$d = E_k/F =", "\\qty{55}{m}$；$v$ 加倍时 $E_k$ 和 $d$ 都变为四倍：\\qty{220}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:3}", "$E_p = \\tfrac12 \\times 500 \\times 0.10^2 = \\qty{2.5}{J}$；$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times", "2.5/0.050} = \\qty{10}{m/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:4}", "$\\tfrac12 mv^2 = mg\\ell(1 - \\cos 60^\\circ)$：$v = \\sqrt{g\\ell} = \\qty{3.1}{m/s}$。", "张力：$T - mg = mv^2/\\ell = mg$，$T = 2mg$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:5}", "摩擦力做功 $-\\mu_dmg\\cos\\alpha\\,(h/\\sin\\alpha)$，故", "\\[", "\\tfrac12 mv^2 = mgh(1 - \\mu_d\\cot\\alpha) = mgh(1 - 0.35),", "\\]", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 2.0 \\times 0.65} = \\qty{5.1}{m/s}$；损失 $35\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:6}", "$E_m = \\tfrac12 mv^2 - GMm/R \\geq 0$ 时物体可到达无穷远", "（此时 $E_p = 0$ 且 $v \\to 0$）：$v_e = \\sqrt{2GM/R}$，即", "\\[", "v_e = \\sqrt{\\frac{2 \\times 6.67\\times10^{-11} \\times 5.97\\times10^{24}}{6.37\\times10^6}}", "= \\qty{11.2}{km/s}.", "\\]", "密度相同，$M \\propto R^3$：$v_e \\propto R$，故 \\qty{22.4}{km/s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:7}", "最低点：$mg(\\ell_0 + x) = \\tfrac12 kx^2$，$25x^2 - 687x - 13734 = 0$，", "$x = \\qty{41}{m}$；总下落 \\qty{61}{m}；$T_{\\max} = kx = \\qty{2.0}{kN}", "= 3.0\\,mg$（合力 \\qty{2}{g} 向上）。速率在合力", "为零处最大，即 $kx = mg$：$x = \\qty{14}{m}$，位于跳台下方 \\qty{34}{m} 处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:8}", "重力：$mgv\\sin\\alpha = 80 \\times 9.81 \\times 5.0 \\times 0.05 = \\qty{196}{W}$；", "阻力：$\\tfrac12\\rho C_xSv^3 = 0.5 \\times 1.2 \\times 0.50 \\times 125 =", "\\qty{38}{W}$；总计 \\qty{234}{W}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:9}", "$E_p' = 4E_0(x^3/a^4 - x/a^2) = 0$：$x = 0, \\pm a$。$E_p'' = E_0(12x^2/a^4 -", "4/a^2)$：$-4E_0/a^2$ 在 $0$ 处（不稳定极大值，$E_p = 0$），$+8E_0/a^2$", "在 $\\pm a$ 处（稳定极小值，$E_p = -E_0$）：深度为 $E_0$ 的势阱；", "$\\omega_0^2 = 8E_0/ma^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:10}", "$\\tfrac12 m\\dot x^2 + \\tfrac12 kx^2 = E$：椭圆，半轴为 $x_{\\max}", "= \\sqrt{2E/k}$ 与 $\\dot x_{\\max} = \\sqrt{2E/m}$。运动为简谐运动，", "周期为 $2\\pi\\sqrt{m/k}$，与振幅无关（等时性），故", "各椭圆所用时间相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:11}", "能量：$v^2 = 2gR(1 - \\cos\\theta)$。径向：$mg\\cos\\theta - N = mv^2/R$，", "故 $N = mg(3\\cos\\theta - 2)$，在 $\\cos\\theta = 2/3$（$\\theta =", "48^\\circ$）处为零：高度 $2R/3$，速率 $\\sqrt{2gR/3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:work-and-energy:12}", "$\\tfrac12 mv^2 = \\mu_dmgd$：$\\mu_d = 625/(2 \\times 9.81 \\times 80) = 0.40$。", "轮胎与路面接触处产生热量（并留下刹车痕迹）。滚动的车轮受", "静摩擦力作用，$\\mu_s > \\mu_d$：制动力更大，", "制动距离更短，并保持转向能力。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:work-and-energy:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $r \\to 0$：$+\\infty$（$r^{-12}$ 项）；$r \\to \\infty$：", "$0^-$。陡峭的壁、一个势阱、一条长尾。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $E_p' = \\epsilon[-12\\sigma^{12}/r^{13} + 12\\sigma^6/r^7] = 0$ 当且仅当", "$(\\sigma/r)^6 = 1$：$r = \\sigma$，$E_p = \\epsilon(1 - 2) = -\\epsilon$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $(\\sigma/r)^{12} = u^2$：$E_p = \\epsilon(u^2 - 2u) = \\epsilon[(u - 1)^2", "- 1]$，在 $u = 1$（$r = \\sigma$）处取最小值 $-\\epsilon$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $F = -E_p' = (12\\epsilon/\\sigma)[(\\sigma/r)^{13} - (\\sigma/r)^7]$：", "$r < \\sigma$ 时为正（斥力），更远处为负（引力）。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $(1/1.2)^6 = 0.335$，$(1/1.2)^{12} = 0.112$：$E_p = \\epsilon(0.112", "- 0.670) = -0.56\\epsilon = \\qty{-2.5}{eV}$。$(1/1.2)^{13} = 0.0935$，", "$(1/1.2)^7 = 0.279$：$F = (12\\epsilon/\\sigma)(-0.186) = -2.2\\epsilon/\\sigma =", "-2.2 \\times 7.0\\times10^{-19}/1.27\\times10^{-10} = \\qty{-12}{nN}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\epsilon = \\qty{4.4}{eV} = 4.4 \\times 96.5 = \\qty{425}{kJ/mol}$，", "接近实测值 \\qty{431}{kJ/mol}。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $E_p'' = \\epsilon[156\\sigma^{12}/r^{14} - 84\\sigma^6/r^8]$；在", "$\\sigma$ 处：$72\\epsilon/\\sigma^2 > 0$：稳定的。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $E_p \\approx -\\epsilon + \\tfrac12(72\\epsilon/\\sigma^2)(r - \\sigma)^2$：", "$k = 72\\epsilon/\\sigma^2$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $k = 72 \\times 7.0\\times10^{-19}/(1.27\\times10^{-10})^2 =", "\\qty{3.1e3}{N/m}$。", ""]}